<title>AUSTRALIA: Cricket-West Indies 441 for five declared v W. Australia.</title>
<headline>Cricket-West Indies 441 for five declared v W. Australia.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the final day of the three day match between the West Indies and Western Australia at the WACA on Sunday.</p>
<p>Western Australia first innings 293 for six declared</p>
<p>West Indies first innings (overnight 387 for four)</p>
<p> R.Samuels b Nicholson		    96</p>
<p> A.Griffith c Gilchrist b Nicholson    9</p>
<p> S.Chanderpaul not out		   135</p>
<p> C.Hooper c Gilchrist b Harvey	  84</p>
<p> J.Adams c Gilchrist b Harvey	    1</p>
<p> R.Holder c Gilchrist b Nicholson     68</p>
<p> J.Murray not out			   30</p>
<p> Extras (b-5 lb-2 w-1 nb-10)	    18</p>
<p> Total (five wickets, declared)	441</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-22 2-229 3-274 4-372 5-424</p>
<p>Did not bat: K.Benjamin, C.Ambrose, C.Walsh, P.Thompson</p>
<p>Bowling: Nicholson 31-3-94-3, Julian 18-4-58-0 (w-1 nb-3), Hogg 24-5-104-0, Harvey 14-1-84-2, Carey 24-6-69-0 (nb-2), Martyn 2-0-6-0, Baker 6-2-19-0.</p>
<p>Note: Western Australia bowled five no balls, each worth two runs.</p>
</text>
